# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Meal AI (api/meal-ai.js)
#
# Locally: copy this file to `.env` and fill in AI_API_KEY, then `npm start`.
# On Vercel: add the same variables under Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables, then redeploy. `.env` is gitignored, never commit a key.
#
# Any provider with an OpenAI-compatible "chat completions" API works.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Google Gemini (free tier, no credit card) ────────────────────────────────
# Key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
AI_API_KEY=
AI_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
AI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest

# ── Backup provider (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used when the main one is out of quota or fails. Groq: https://console.groq.com/keys
# AI_FALLBACK_API_KEY=
# AI_FALLBACK_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# AI_FALLBACK_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
